    <task id="Id_8f5bafdd-a303-4c78-ba6c-aa200bba908c" name="5.7.2 a) Verification approved">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. A contratada deve autorizar o modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e instruir cada equipe de tarefas para submeter suas infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pela contratante no ambiente comum de dados (CDE) do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
